WEBVTT

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:02.820
Catarina Claes.

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:05.820
I need you to disappear along 
with Prince Geordo.

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:07.060
What does that mean?!

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:09.550
Just who is that butler, anyway?!

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:12.410
I can't fathom why he suddenly 
put Selena to sleep, either.

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:14.660
It's almost like dark magic!

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:16.600
You're right!

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.920
It's just like when Catarina 
was put to sleep in the past!

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:21.420
Does that mean Rufus has dark magic?!

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:25.240
So... is it possible he's killed people, too?

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:30.620
<i>There's no way I can get to sleep.</i>

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:34.760
<b>Doom</b>

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:58.570
<b>m 0 0 l 0 -7 b 7 -7 15 -15 15 -29 l 30 -30 l 29 -15 b 15 -15 7 -7 7 0 b 7 7 15 15 29 15 l 30 30 l 15 29 b 15 15 7 7 0 7 b -7 7 -15 15 -15 29 l -30 30 l -29 15 b -15 15 -7 7 -7 0 b -7 -7 -15 -15 -29 -15 l -30 -30 l -15 -29 b -15 -15 -7 -7 0 -7</b>

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:58.570
<b>My Next Life as a Villainess: 
All Routes Lead to Doom!</b>

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:05.770
<b>Episode 4 
I Had a Friendly Tea Time With an Attractive Butler...</b>

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:07.710
Unbelievable.

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:09.900
Does she have nerves of steel or what?

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:12.400
Rufus?

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:14.890
Do you not think it's 
time you woke up already?

00:02:14.890 --> 00:02:16.440
It's past noon.

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:18.120
What?! Past noon already?!

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:20.530
That's the part you react to?

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:23.130
I'm shocked at myself...

00:02:23.130 --> 00:02:25.750
<i>I can't believe my enemy 
had to wake me up!</i>

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:28.580
Trust me, I am far more shocked.

00:02:29.070 --> 00:02:31.330
There's a lot I want to ask you,

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:33.010
but first, is Selena all right?

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:40.110
You surpass the rumors I've heard about you.

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:42.170
Lady Selena is just fine.

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:44.430
She's in her room right now.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:45.630
Oh...

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:49.470
Rufus, do you have dark magic?

00:02:50.910 --> 00:02:53.060
That's rather direct.

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:55.900
I couldn't think of a way 
to ask you indirectly.

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:58.510
You truly are an unusual person.

00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:01.530
And you even know about dark magic.

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:04.740
You were involved in that 
incident last year, weren't you?

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:07.390
Are you surprised?

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:10.320
The existence of dark magic 
was being kept hidden,

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:13.310
but there was no way that 
could remain a secret forever.

00:03:13.310 --> 00:03:16.590
Especially to nobles who are close 
to the family of Marquis Dieke,

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:20.040
who engaged in some questionable 
dealings with them.

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:23.340
And then <i>he</i> discovered dark magic.

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:24.260
"He"?

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:26.360
I refer to my master.

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:29.600
I obtained dark magic under his orders,

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:31.690
and that is why I've come here.

00:03:33.110 --> 00:03:34.690
To do what?

00:03:34.890 --> 00:03:36.690
Did I not tell you?

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:41.110
To make Lady Selena assume all 
responsibility for this kidnapping,

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:46.420
and to remove both her and Prince Ian 
from the race for the throne...

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:48.910
along with you and Prince Geordo.

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:51.370
Wh-Why?

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:57.280
Because my master wants Prince Jeffrey, 
the first prince, to be king.

00:03:57.280 --> 00:04:01.340
And I will do whatever it 
takes to help my master.

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:03.930
<i>To make Jeffrey king...</i>

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:06.960
<i>And Ian and Geordo are in the way of that?</i>

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:11.140
<i>Wait, what about Alan?</i>

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:13.600
Why am I the only one left off the list?

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:15.460
<i>No, Alan's time is yet to come!</i>

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:17.440
<i>He's still growing. That's all!</i>

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:21.310
Even you must be feeling scared now, right?

00:04:21.310 --> 00:04:23.780
Well, enough of this little chat.

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:27.620
I will leave your breakfast here. 
Please enjoy.

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:30.120
If you need anything, you can ring this bell.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:38.250
This isn't very much...

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:44.090
Wh-What is this?! It's delicious!

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:52.890
Oh, dear. Have you finally 
begun to feel discouraged?

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:56.230
No, I'd like some more food. 
This wasn't nearly enough.

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:59.160
Some sweets and tea would be great!

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:05.400
Unbelievable. You really 
do have nerves of steel.

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:07.280
Are you really the daughter of a noble?

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:10.030
<i>Maybe he actually is a pretty nice guy.</i>

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:12.000
Here, it's ready. Enjoy.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.400
Thanks!

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:15.250
Hey, you should join me.

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:18.730
I really can't believe you...

00:05:18.730 --> 00:05:20.330
Oh, forget it.

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:23.610
No point in continuing to be 
surprised by every little thing.

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:25.920
Did the way you speak to me just change?

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:27.160
Yeah.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:31.410
It felt dumb putting on an 
act for someone like you.

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:34.060
If it displeases the lady, 
I shall speak in this manner again.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.110
No, this way is fine.

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:37.860
Thought so.

00:05:37.860 --> 00:05:41.440
If it was an act, does that mean 
you're not really a butler?

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:43.640
Do I look like a butler to you right now?

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:44.670
No.

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:47.740
You just look like the type 
of young guy I'd see downtown.

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:50.580
Wow, you're exactly right.

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:52.160
I'm impressed.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:55.610
Also, you're a noble, but you go downtown?

00:05:55.610 --> 00:05:57.430
Sometimes, in secret.

00:05:57.430 --> 00:05:59.120
You live around there?

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:01.750
No, you're just mostly right.

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:03.340
I was born in the slums,

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:05.340
and I'm not from this country.

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:07.310
What? You're not?

00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:10.730
I was taken by slave 
traders when I was a kid,

00:06:10.730 --> 00:06:15.010
and eventually, my current master bought me.

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:17.850
Surprised?

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:22.430
It might be tough to believe for a 
noble who was raised with utmost care,

00:06:22.430 --> 00:06:25.990
but it happens all the time 
in the poorer countries.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:28.400
I'm actually one of the lucky ones.

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:32.610
I'm alive, I'm healthy, and I even 
get to wear nice clothes like these.

00:06:32.610 --> 00:06:34.950
I'm incredibly fortunate.

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.540
I bet even you're freaked out now, huh?

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:42.170
Or do you think I'm pitiful 
and feel sorry for me?

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:45.080
Sorry, but I don't need any of that.

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:48.880
I don't consider myself 
unfortunate at all, anyway.

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:51.850
That's so admirable...

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:53.720
Huh?

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:56.310
I really admire you!

00:06:57.770 --> 00:06:59.840
Uh, where's this coming from?

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:03.120
I know I'm relatively good-looking, but...

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:05.160
No, I'm not talking about your looks.

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:08.280
I'm talking about on the inside! 
The way you think!

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:10.780
What does that mean? I don't get it.

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:14.160
That optimistic mindset 
you have is so admirable!

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:22.220
<i>Huh? Was that too rude?</i>

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:35.880
You're a fascinating person, you know that?

00:07:36.130 --> 00:07:37.850
Uh-huh...

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:39.840
Okay, let's talk some more.

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:42.070
I want to talk with you more now.

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:43.330
Okay...

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:02.040
Hey, Rufus...

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:05.940
When you got your dark magic... uh...

00:08:05.940 --> 00:08:08.600
Oh, the sacrifice thing?

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:11.030
My master put me to sleep with a drug.

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:14.470
When I woke up, I could use dark magic.

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.350
He didn't even give me a choice.

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:21.390
So if you're not really a butler, 
is "Rufus" a fake name, too?

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:22.660
Yeah, of course.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:24.810
What's your real name, then?

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:27.260
I have all kinds of names.

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:29.850
I've used a different one everywhere I went.

00:08:29.850 --> 00:08:31.660
I don't have parents,

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:35.620
so as far back as I can remember, I was 
scrounging through garbage in the slums.

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:40.200
<i>Wow... Up close like this, 
he looks super attractive...</i>

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:43.950
<i>He even has the mole under his eye 
that sexy characters always have!</i>

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:47.070
Hey, why'd you freeze up?

00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:48.950
So beautiful...

00:08:48.950 --> 00:08:49.710
Huh?

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:52.640
Your eyes. They're beautiful.

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:54.310
They're the color of a clear sky.

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:58.140
You're...

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:26.920
I guess I should have dinner brought in, huh?

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:50.230
As far back as I can remember,

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:53.030
I lived with my buddies in the slums.

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:57.990
We stole things and tricked people to get 
by like it was the natural thing to do.

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:03.550
The big turning point in my life 
was when he showed up on my turf.

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:11.850
This guy who'd come from the outside world

00:10:11.850 --> 00:10:15.800
taught me how to read and write, 
do math, and lots of other stuff.

00:10:23.650 --> 00:10:25.550
By the way, what's your name?

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:28.640
I don't have one. I don't even 
know what my parents looked like.

00:10:29.220 --> 00:10:30.940
Really?

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:33.860
Then from now on, your name is Sora.

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:35.140
Sora?

00:10:35.140 --> 00:10:36.060
Yeah.

00:10:36.060 --> 00:10:39.440
Because your eyes are as 
beautiful as the blue sky.

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:42.540
Sora, huh?

00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:44.870
Well, it's not bad, I guess.

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:46.120
Hey!

00:10:46.730 --> 00:10:48.950
What're you doing?! Cut it out!

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:51.710
What the heck...

00:10:57.340 --> 00:11:00.320
Hey, tell me about the outside world.

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:01.550
This is unusual.

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:02.470
Huh?

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:06.430
Most people around here don't like 
it when I talk about the outside.

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:08.060
Why?

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:13.230
Probably because it makes them 
more aware of their own situation.

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:15.690
You all try your hardest just 
to live through the day,

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:19.550
so hearing about kids on the outside 
who are cared for by their parents

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:22.190
must be really painful.

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:24.760
Do you feel discontent 
with the life you have?

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:25.920
Nope.

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:27.470
Like hell I don't!

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:29.520
I want to sleep in a warm futon at night

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:31.040
and eat my fill of good food, too!

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:34.920
But I don't think I'm 
unfortunate or anything.

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:37.050
I'm alive and well every day,

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:40.480
and I get to listen to 
all of your cool stories.

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:42.380
That's enough for me.

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:47.220
The way you think is so admirable.

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:49.560
Wh-Where the heck did that come from?

00:11:51.530 --> 00:11:55.260
Sora, I want you to think that 
way for the rest of your life.

00:11:55.260 --> 00:11:59.040
Keep facing forward, and don't 
be swayed by what others say.

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:03.450
It wasn't long after that

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:06.080
when he fell ill.

00:12:13.470 --> 00:12:17.280
The only way to cure him was 
with expensive medicine...

00:12:17.280 --> 00:12:22.340
The kind of medicine that we slum folk 
could never afford in our entire lives.

00:13:06.350 --> 00:13:07.550
Where'd he go?!

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:08.590
That way!

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:15.640
L-Let me go!

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:19.850
Please! He's... He's waiting for me!

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:22.940
Let me go!

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:32.410
Never thought I'd meet someone 
who'd say the same thing he did.

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:37.500
Your stories of other countries 
are so interesting!

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:40.540
Your stories are pretty interesting, too.

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:41.790
Thanks!

00:13:41.790 --> 00:13:45.880
I've never left this country, 
so I'd love to visit others.

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:51.140
I'm starting to think I wouldn't mind 
visiting other countries again if it was with you.

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:53.980
Really?! Then take me with you next time!

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:58.520
You and I come from different worlds.

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:00.780
There's no way we could go together.

00:14:00.780 --> 00:14:02.380
Different worlds?

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:03.520
What do you mean?

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:05.770
You're right here in front of me, aren't you?

00:14:06.960 --> 00:14:09.310
We're talking and eating dinner together.

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:11.220
We're in the same world.

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:14.040
Okay, I get it.

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:15.790
I'll take you with me next time.

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:18.150
Yay! I've got a travel buddy!

00:14:18.150 --> 00:14:20.460
Let's make a promise, then! Pinky swear!

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:21.460
Pinky swear?

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:24.690
<i>Oh, right. They don't 
have that in this world.</i>

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:27.180
<i>So... how do they make promises here?</i>

00:14:27.180 --> 00:14:28.180
That's it!

00:14:30.600 --> 00:14:31.870
What's this?

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:34.090
It's a beautiful color, isn't it?

00:14:34.090 --> 00:14:36.300
It's the same color as your eyes.

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:37.760
The color of the blue sky.

00:14:39.030 --> 00:14:41.900
And when you hold it up 
to the light like this,

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:44.090
it looks like the color of my eyes!

00:14:44.090 --> 00:14:46.740
It's perfect for a promise 
between you and me, isn't it?

00:14:50.650 --> 00:14:53.200
Eh? What? What are you doing?

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:08.320
For some reason, my chest 
feels warm when I'm with you.

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:11.470
It's been such a long time 
since I felt this way.

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:14.520
So... why don't you become mine?

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:17.300
When you look at me with those shining eyes,

00:15:17.300 --> 00:15:19.930
you can't complain about 
whatever I do to you.

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:22.740
<i>Wh-Wh-What is going on right now?!</i>

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:25.760
<i>Wait, is he trying to put me 
to sleep with dark magic?!</i>

00:15:25.760 --> 00:15:28.520
Um, wait... Rufus...

00:15:28.520 --> 00:15:29.780
Huh?

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:33.080
Master Rufus! Are you in there?!

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:35.440
Tch... I'm busy right at the moment.

00:15:35.440 --> 00:15:37.260
It's an urgent matter!

00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:39.630
Just when it was getting good...

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:43.580
You've received an urgent letter.

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:48.210
I believe it would be in your best 
interest to read it immediately.

00:15:49.220 --> 00:15:50.810
Are you...

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:53.430
Oh, well. Guess it was inevitable.

00:15:54.380 --> 00:15:56.640
Lady Catarina, are you all right?!

00:15:56.640 --> 00:15:57.880
I'm fine.

00:15:57.880 --> 00:16:00.600
I think he was about to 
cast magic on me, though.

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:03.360
What? Magic? That's what it was?

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:08.040
So the investigation has 
reached Mason's mansion?

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:09.910
Well, he's done for.

00:16:10.140 --> 00:16:13.080
So what should I do now?

00:16:20.310 --> 00:16:22.570
Catarina. Catarina.

00:16:22.570 --> 00:16:23.470
Huh?

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:28.880
You really are a deep sleeper.

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:30.460
Wh-What do you want?

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:33.380
I figured you'd be wary of me now.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:35.560
I won't do anything to you again.

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:37.880
Looks like it's all coming 
to an end now, after all.

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:38.970
Coming to an end?

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:40.080
Yeah.

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:43.950
As much as I would've liked fleeing 
to another country with you,

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:46.400
it just wouldn't be possible, 
so I dropped the idea.

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:50.130
And this magic is probably going 
to cause a lot of problems,

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:53.280
so I thought I should just behave 
for now and let them take me in.

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:56.890
Of course, that means I won't 
be able to see you for a while,

00:16:56.890 --> 00:17:00.180
so I came to see your face one last time.

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:02.620
What do you mean, "last"?

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:05.520
Oh, that was quicker than I expected.

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:06.650
Lady Catarina!

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:07.590
Are you all right?!

00:17:07.590 --> 00:17:09.050
Huh? Why...

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:11.050
are all of you here?

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:15.680
Lana?

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:18.810
Yes, that's the name I was going by before,

00:17:18.810 --> 00:17:21.140
but please allow me to 
properly introduce myself.

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:23.870
I'm Larna Smith of the Department of Magic.

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:25.230
Nice to meet you.

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:26.350
what?!

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:31.230
Since you're still here, I assume 
you've resigned yourself to your fate.

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:35.200
Yes, I'll go with you 
and tell you everything.

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:37.500
That's a good attitude.

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:38.560
Take him.

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:43.490
H-Hey!

00:17:52.850 --> 00:17:55.090
I'll hold on to our promise.

00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:57.580
Okay!

00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:01.300
Thanks, everyone.

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:03.280
Sorry I worried you.

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:06.890
And, um, Miss Larna... 
Thank you for saving me.

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:11.020
No, I've wanted to have a chat 
with you for a long time,

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:12.870
so I enjoyed every moment of it.

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:14.360
Huh? Every moment?

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:17.340
This is the superior I told you 
about at the school festival.

00:18:17.340 --> 00:18:21.270
Um... Does this mean we've 
met at some point before?

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:24.040
Yes, this is the first time 
you've seen this identity,

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:25.800
so it makes sense that 
you don't recognize me.

00:18:25.800 --> 00:18:27.420
This identity?

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:31.600
She's a master of disguise, 
so she has many identities.

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:35.590
Um... and which identity 
was it that I met before?

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:42.350
You really are adorable.

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:44.890
I said I'd hug you the next 
time we met, remember?

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:46.750
Eh? Uh...

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:50.120
That's enough! Give Catarina back already!

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:52.030
What a short-tempered prince you are.

00:18:52.030 --> 00:18:54.210
I almost forgot! Is Lady Selena safe?!

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:56.190
No need to worry.

00:18:57.280 --> 00:18:59.150
Selena! Selena!

00:19:02.970 --> 00:19:04.360
Prince Ian?

00:19:05.130 --> 00:19:07.390
Selena... Thank goodness.

00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:09.800
They told me everything.

00:19:09.800 --> 00:19:11.500
Sorry you went through that for me.

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:15.040
N-No, it was my own choice to do it.

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:19.310
I'm truly sorry I did all this without 
thinking and caused trouble for you.

00:19:19.310 --> 00:19:22.130
You couldn't help it. 
You were being controlled.

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:23.360
Don't worry.

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:27.400
More importantly... I'm so glad you're safe.

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:33.320
You need to find out from him personally!

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:41.110
U-Um... Prince Ian, you don't hate me?

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:44.330
What are you talking about? Of course not.

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:47.960
Um... But you don't come to see me often,

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:50.750
and when we do meet, 
you're quite short with me.

00:19:51.480 --> 00:19:54.260
Oh... That's because, uh...

00:19:56.420 --> 00:20:01.000
You're just so cute, I have 
trouble controlling myself.

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:05.820
We're still just engaged. 
We're not married yet.

00:20:05.820 --> 00:20:08.680
So it's not a good idea for us 
to cling to each other too much.

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:12.040
I realize that, but when 
I look at you, I just...

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:16.480
can't help wanting to touch you 
because you're so charming.

00:20:16.840 --> 00:20:20.060
So I've been trying to stay 
as far away as possible.

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:24.080
But if that gave you the 
wrong idea, I'm sorry.

00:20:24.670 --> 00:20:26.640
Allow me to state it clearly, right now.

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:30.840
I, Ian Stuart, am in love with Selena Berg.

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:37.230
U-Uh...

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:41.920
So Prince Ian's here, too?

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:42.930
Yeah.

00:20:42.930 --> 00:20:46.220
When he heard the story, 
he turned pale and rushed here.

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:49.140
He seemed to be deeply 
worried about Lady Selena.

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:51.740
I see! That's great!

00:20:51.740 --> 00:20:54.750
But I'm so glad nothing 
happened to you, Catarina.

00:20:54.750 --> 00:20:57.300
Try to be more careful from now on, will you?

00:20:57.300 --> 00:20:58.180
For real.

00:20:58.180 --> 00:20:59.100
Be careful.

00:20:59.100 --> 00:21:00.610
Understood.

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:02.200
That aside, Catarina...

00:21:02.200 --> 00:21:06.300
Why does your skin seem so oddly radiant 
despite having been kidnapped?

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:08.120
D-Does it?

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:11.410
<i>I can't tell him I had a more 
comfortable life here than at home...</i>

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:13.500
What happened there?

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:14.120
Huh?

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:16.040
That mark on your neck.

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:18.670
Oh... I think a bug bit me.

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:20.430
A bug?

00:21:20.430 --> 00:21:23.630
Yeah. When Rufus pushed me down onto the bed.

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:25.640
He pushed you down onto the bed?!

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:27.990
What's the meaning of this?!

00:21:27.990 --> 00:21:31.230
Um, he suddenly pushed me down 
onto the bed last night...

00:21:31.230 --> 00:21:33.890
I think that's when a bug got in and bit me.

00:21:33.890 --> 00:21:37.570
I'm pretty sure Rufus was trying 
to put me to sleep with magic...

00:21:38.880 --> 00:21:40.320
A bug again...

00:21:40.870 --> 00:21:43.800
I was trying to take it 
slow to match your pace...

00:21:43.800 --> 00:21:46.990
At this rate, you might be taken 
away from me before I even know it.

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:49.450
I'm done waiting.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:53.710
I couldn't bear it if someone 
else took you from me.

00:22:47.970 --> 00:22:48.630
<b>Secret Catarina</b>

00:22:54.810 --> 00:22:55.470
<b>Secret Catarina</b>

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:03.860
<b>Secret Catarina</b>

00:23:10.150 --> 00:23:10.820
<b>Secret Catarina</b>
